DATA NOT SHIPPED WITH THIS SOFTWARE
-----------------------------------

  DB-IP Country Lite ............ CC BY 4.0
      https://db-ip.com/db/download/ip-to-country-lite
      SHELLHOUND can download this database into your workspace on an
      explicit click. It is NOT redistributed as part of this repository.
      If you publish results derived from it, DB-IP asks for attribution:
      "IP Geolocation by DB-IP" with a link to https://db-ip.com.

  MaxMind GeoLite2-Country ...... alternative, requires a MaxMind account
      https://dev.maxmind.com/geoip/geolite2-free-geolocation-data
      Supported as a drop-in alternative; not downloaded automatically and
      not redistributed here.

No sample data in this repository is taken from a real incident. The test
fixtures (tests/fixtures.py) use documentation-reserved addresses
(RFC 5737), .test domains (RFC 6761) and minimal detection-test files.
